# Larger background groups and click-spawned strawberry cream

Status: DONE PUBLIC
Milestone: M77 Larger interactive cream without input regressions
Dependencies: 80_LIVING_STRAWBERRY_CURSOR.todo, 81_LONGER_LIVING_CURSOR_TRAIL.todo

## Purpose

The owner revised the initial3Xrequest to2Xfor background and spawned blobs only,
leaving the cursor size unchanged. The later individual-blob request confirms2X
total, not an additional cumulative doubling. Add more grouped blobs and big
strawberry blobs on clicks, without the cursor disappearing.
The later02:39request moves the largest ambient groups to the outer edges,
avoiding the central glass column except for a small edge overlap. Click-spawned
blobs still originate at their click positions.

