## Acceptance criteria

-2Xis measured relative to the prior release; it is not silently clamped back down.
- Large ambient groups may extend offscreen rather than cover the center or shrink.
- Edge placement holds through drift, breathing, split/rejoin and viewport changes.
- The cursor is not enlarged. Plain clicks do not hide it; native viewers still use native pointers.
- No unbounded accumulation: only the newest8spawns remain, with no persistent storage.
- Touch scrolls and modified/secondary/keyboard clicks do not create accidental spawns.
- Notebook, photo, navigation, keyboard and pause actions continue to work.
- Reading contrast, full themed glass and current2Xmotion remain; originals/local study stay unchanged.

